ke accountable decisions, bypass controls, or approve release", "module_continuity_link": "The Context Configuration and Retrieval Record defines the context behaviour that the validation plan must test."}'::jsonb, '{"technical_concepts_learnt": "Acceptance criteria, prompt architecture, context filters, retrieval fallback, validation coverage, defect classification, controlled fixes, regression testing, and release-readiness evidence", "academic_refresher_concepts": "Systems thinking, requirements engineering, experimental design, root-cause reasoning within scope, evidence evaluation, and technical reporting"}'::jsonb, 'The workflow requires reliable context selection and retrieval behaviour, but source scope, filters, fallback and traceability must be configured. The learner must create a standard context plan and escalate any non-routine access or policy issue.', '{"items": ["Microsoft Excel", "Microsoft PowerPoint", "Microsoft Word", "ChatGPT Enterprise sandbox", "Microsoft SharePoint", "Microsoft Edge"]}'::jsonb, TRUE, TRUE)
