rove release", "module_continuity_link": "The Workflow Validation Test Plan becomes the execution baseline for defect resolution."}'::jsonb, '{"technical_concepts_learnt": "Acceptance criteria, prompt architecture, context filters, retrieval fallback, validation coverage, defect classification, controlled fixes, regression testing, and release-readiness evidence", "academic_refresher_concepts": "Systems thinking, requirements engineering, experimental design, root-cause reasoning within scope, evidence evaluation, and technical reporting"}'::jsonb, 'The designed workflow cannot be considered ready for testing until the learner defines sufficient standard validation coverage. The learner must build a test plan that links acceptance criteria to test cases and expected evidence.', '{"items": ["Microsoft Excel", "Microsoft PowerPoint", "Microsoft Word", "ChatGPT Enterprise sandbox", "Microsoft SharePoint", "Microsoft Edge"]}'::jsonb, TRUE, TRUE)
