 not create missing evidence, make accountable decisions, bypass controls, or approve release", "module_continuity_link": "The Standard GenAI Workflow Validation Handoff Pack becomes the course-level proof of independent standard-workflow capability."}'::jsonb, '{"technical_concepts_learnt": "Acceptance criteria, prompt architecture, context filters, retrieval fallback, validation coverage, defect classification, controlled fixes, regression testing, and release-readiness evidence", "academic_refresher_concepts": "Systems thinking, requirements engineering, experimental design, root-cause reasoning within scope, evidence evaluation, and technical reporting"}'::jsonb, 'The standard workflow has been designed, configured and tested. The learner must determine whether the evidence meets the approved acceptance criteria and prepare a complete validation handoff without taking final production-release authority.', '{"items": ["Microsoft Excel", "Microsoft PowerPoint", "Microsoft Word", "ChatGPT Enterprise sandbox", "Microsoft SharePoint", "Microsoft Edge"]}'::jsonb, TRUE, TRUE)
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
