ot create missing evidence, make accountable decisions, bypass controls, or approve release", "module_continuity_link": "The Adaptive GenAI Workflow Design Recommendation Pack becomes the course-level proof of adaptive design capability."}'::jsonb, '{"technical_concepts_learnt": "Ambiguity registers, option matrices, retrieval-risk controls, edge-case coverage, scenario comparison, confidence statements, residual-risk logs, and recommendation conditions", "academic_refresher_concepts": "Decision analysis, risk assessment, comparative evaluation, adaptive expertise, argumentation, stakeholder reasoning, and reflective judgement"}'::jsonb, 'Stakeholders need a defensible design recommendation for the ambiguous workflow, but final approval remains outside the learner’s authority. The learner must integrate options, evidence, trade-offs, controls and residual risks into an accountable recommendation.', '{"items": ["Microsoft Excel", "Microsoft PowerPoint", "Microsoft Word", "ChatGPT Enterprise sandbox", "Microsoft SharePoint", "Microsoft Edge"]}'::jsonb, TRUE, TRUE)
