traceability, and revision quality; AI must not create missing evidence, make accountable decisions, bypass controls, or approve release", "module_continuity_link": "The Prompt and Context Pattern Library Entry becomes a reusable governed asset under the design standard."}'::jsonb, '{"technical_concepts_learnt": "Governance models, control plans, standards architecture, pattern-library metadata, cross-workflow analysis, reviewer calibration, coaching evidence, adoption metrics, and review cadence", "academic_refresher_concepts": "Organisational learning, governance design, quality assurance, systems analysis, coaching theory, change management, and strategic communication"}'::jsonb, 'Teams repeatedly solve similar prompt and context problems but lack reusable, governed patterns. The learner must convert proven practices into reusable entries with clear applicability, limitations and controls.', '{"items": ["Microsoft Excel", "Microsoft PowerPoint", "Microsoft Word", "Microsoft SharePoint", "ChatGPT Enterprise", "Microsoft Teams"]}'::jsonb, TRUE, TRUE)
