clear reasoning, weak boundary wording, incomplete traceability, and revision quality; AI must not create missing evidence, make accountable decisions, bypass controls, or approve release", "module_continuity_link": "The GenAI Workflow Governance and Scale Pack becomes the course-level proof of expert practice leadership and scale governance."}'::jsonb, '{"technical_concepts_learnt": "Governance models, control plans, standards architecture, pattern-library metadata, cross-workflow analysis, reviewer calibration, coaching evidence, adoption metrics, and review cadence", "academic_refresher_concepts": "Organisational learning, governance design, quality assurance, systems analysis, coaching theory, change management, and strategic communication"}'::jsonb, 'Northstar Retail needs an integrated approach for scaling GenAI workflow design while preserving quality, evidence, ownership and governance. The learner must combine standards, patterns, controls, systemic analysis and capability development into one scale plan.', '{"items": ["Microsoft Excel", "Microsoft PowerPoint", "Microsoft Word", "Microsoft SharePoint", "ChatGPT Enterprise", "Microsoft Teams"]}'::jsonb, TRUE, TRUE)
